			description: [
				"A furnace burns wood. A &6Wood Retort&r cooks it in a sealed box, and the wood comes apart: &e4 logs&r give &e3 Charcoal&r and &e1,000 mB&r of &6Charcoal Byproducts&r every &e30 s&r, with no fuel at all."
				""
				"Build it like a Coke Oven, but taller: a hollow &e3×3×4&r of &6Firebricks&r with the controller in the middle of a face. Coke Oven Hatches in the walls automate it."
				""
				"&aReal fact:&r until the 1920s, almost all of the world's methanol came from cooking wood. That is why it was called wood alcohol."
